  "name": "static",
  "description": "A static file-serving middleware for the Iron web framework that maps URL paths to local filesystem resources. It supports automated directory index resolution, trailing slash redirection for path normalization, and integrates a specialized caching handler using Last-Modified headers for 304 Not Modified responses. The implementation provides a modular interface for serving assets with accurate MIME type detection via conduit-mime-types.",
